// BT-3766: the raising `on:do:` loop of `SsbOnDoRaiseClass`, instance side and
// outside any class invocation, so the catch arm's `restore/1` gets `none`.

Value subclass: SsbOnDoRaiseObject

  run: n :: Integer -> Integer =>
    1 to: n do: [:i | [Error signal: "x"] on: Error do: [:e | 0]]
    n
